# Protomaps API key for full global vector tiles when online.
# Create one at https://protomaps.com/ (dashboard) and restrict its CORS origins
# to your domains (e.g. https://*.chrisj.uk, plus http://localhost:5173 for dev).
# Also set this same variable in the Vercel project's Environment Variables.
# Without it, the app still works offline-style (bundled Great Britain tiles).
VITE_PROTOMAPS_KEY=

# Read-only token for the PRIVATE restaurant-data repo (chrisJuresh/eater-map-data).
# The build fetches static/data/restaurants.json from there (see scripts/fetch-data.mjs).
# Create a fine-grained PAT with "Contents: Read-only" on that repo, set it here for a
# local fresh fetch, and add the same variable in Vercel's Environment Variables (all envs).
# Not needed if static/data/restaurants.json is already present locally.
DATA_REPO_TOKEN=
